#: inc/translations/strings.php:4096
msgctxt "Settings page"
msgid "All message data is stored on your own server in your WordPress database. When the WebSocket version is used for real-time delivery, data is transmitted encrypted and is not stored on external servers. An additional end-to-end encryption (E2EE) option is available for maximum privacy in WebSocket version."
